{"title":"2013 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>An <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/5/22502aeb762125f5f1d8786beadbcd287716de69.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8 \\times 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> grid is placed in the first quadrant with its edges along the axes, as shown. A total of 32 of the squares in the grid are shaded. A line is drawn through <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/b/c4b86f54134d69cad8793688a431aa907aaf2698.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0, 0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/0/cf0b9d1abbdb2793f94bcad2ce9a0529b3ed35e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(8, c)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> cutting the shaded region into two equal areas. What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can add point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/0/cf0b9d1abbdb2793f94bcad2ce9a0529b3ed35e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(8, c)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> to the grid, and draw the line between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/b/c4b86f54134d69cad8793688a431aa907aaf2698.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0, 0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/0/cf0b9d1abbdb2793f94bcad2ce9a0529b3ed35e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(8, c)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" />:\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>We see that this forms a right triangle, so the area of the triangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/6/be6b2bc02c32368bcdc0d1395914c36b02033769.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{8 \\times c}{2} = 4c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"86\" height=\"38\" />. Since the total area of the shaded region is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/4/4f4b8590f8aa9f9894b3891dd5dede0e354fa04e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and the line cuts the area into two, the area of this triangle must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/d/3fd707257bfae1e09affe643793e5eddf02cf99f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{32}{2} = 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"64\" height=\"37\" />. We then have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/c/23cdc8e7f44a9d226d849ac458de2a03d12bad7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4c = 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/2/2e2ebc56071d84aef23d566d206369c4f745726b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = \\frac{16}{4} = \\boxed{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"101\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can see that we can move a square from the top right (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/c/e4c044326e2e84b768dafef07060bd42b0a5cb21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\times 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />) to form a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/2/fb20f510014d8f07526f3fe885eedb4e86eb3238.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8 \\times 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> rectangle:\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Since this is a rectangle, we can realize that this would then be cut in half through the diagonal going through <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/b/c4b86f54134d69cad8793688a431aa907aaf2698.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0, 0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/6/616ce58e3a7181a2ea5ec2794a1f525d837b1175.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(8, 4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" />. This easily allows us to see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/8/7c8892e66e11cb7189cd543bbfb75de510026dfc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{c = 4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"54\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CIMC\" title=\"2013 CIMC\">2013 CIMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CIMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CIMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CIMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CIMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3\" title=\"2013 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 3\">Part A Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Part A Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1\" title=\"2013 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 1\">Part A 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2013 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 2\">Part A 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3\" title=\"2013 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 3\">Part A 3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Part A 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Part A 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Part A 6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">Part B 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Part B 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2013 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part B 3</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Intermediate_Competition\" title=\"CEMC Intermediate Competition\">CEMC Intermediate Competition</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018055732\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.030 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.050 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 152/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2249/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 140/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3059/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   15.195      1 -total\n 47.27%    7.182      1 Templat